column5:
Ulric walks up to the blade and lifts it up with ease.{w}
You'd have to be pretty strong to lift something like that.{w}
A few of the people watching this exchange start to laugh.{w}
Pro — saying absolutely nothing — slowly walks away.

column6:
乌尔里克走到剑前，轻松地把它提了起来。{w}
要举起那样的东西，得相当强壮才行。{w}
几个围观这场交锋的人笑了起来。{w}
普洛——一言不发——慢慢走开了。
